<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-AUSTRALIAN OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-AUSTRALIAN OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round scores and</p>
<p>totals in the Australian Open at the par-72 Australian Golf Club</p>
<p>course on Sunday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>280  Greg Norman 67 73 71 69</p>
<p>288  Wayne Grady 70 77 72 69</p>
<p>290  David Smail (New Zealand) 72 73 72 73</p>
<p>291  Klas Eriksson (Sweden) 68 71 76 76</p>
<p>292  Peter O'Malley 78 74 71 69, Grant Waite (New Zealand) 72 75</p>
<p>     74 71, Paul McGinley (Ireland) 76 74 72 70, Tiger Woods (U.S.)</p>
<p>     79 72 71 70</p>
<p>293  Peter Lonard 78 73 74 68, Anthony Painter 72 75 71 75</p>
<p>294  Jon Evans 75 74 75 70, Jean-Louis Guepy (France) 72 74 75</p>
<p>     73, Terry Price 73 73 76 72</p>
<p>295  Richard Green 70 75 77 73, Steve Alker (New Zealand) 72 78</p>
<p>     73 72, Lindsay Stephen 75 73 74 73, Robert Stephens 69 79 74 73,</p>
<p>     Rolf Muntz (Netherlands) 71 71 79 74</p>
